AUTHORIZE
RELEASE
CANCEL
REJECT
APPROVE
DECLINE
VERIFY
SETTLE
REFUND

Technical keywords

API
UI
DATABASE
KAFKA
RABBITMQ
FILE
SFTP
CACHE
EXTERNAL_SYSTEM

Validation keywords

VALIDATE
ASSERT
VERIFY
