3. Tags

Tags are the metadata attached to Cucumber Features/Scenarios.

I recommend grouping tags by purpose rather than creating hundreds of unrelated tags.

Journey tags

@journey=ACH_PAYMENT
@journeyId=ACH-JRN-001
@journeyVersion=1.0

Business tags

@domain=CashManagement
@capability=PaymentProcessing
@businessProcess=ACH
@criticality=Critical
@actor=CorporateUser

Test tags

@testType=E2E
@testLevel=System
@priority=P1

Environment tags

@environment=QA
@region=US

Traceability tags

@requirement=REQ-PAY-001
@story=PAY-123
@defect=BUG-456

Execution tags

@timeout=120s
@retry=2
@parallel=true

Technical tags

@system=PaymentAPI
@service=PaymentService
@component=AuthorizationEngine

