5. Add keywords to each step

I would maintain a separate metadata mapping rather than cluttering Gherkin with tags on every line.

For example:

Step	Keyword	System	Component	Expected Outcome
Create payment	CREATE	Payment UI	Payment UI	Payment Created
Submit payment	SUBMIT	Payment API	Payment Service	Payment Submitted
Validate entitlement	VALIDATE	Payment API	Entitlement Service	Entitled
Validate payment	VALIDATE	Payment API	Validation Service	Valid
Authorize	AUTHORIZE	Payment API	Authorization Engine	Authorized
Release	RELEASE	Payment API	Payment Service	Released
Publish to bank	PUBLISH	Kafka	Bank Adapter	Published
Bank accepts	VERIFY	Bank	External System	Accepted

